<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Status-bar icon for the arrival notification.

  Android renders this as a MONOCHROME MASK: every non-transparent pixel becomes
  solid white, and colour is discarded. So it has to read as a silhouette — a
  detailed brain would come out as a white blob at 24dp. A map pin says what the
  notification is actually about, which is the only thing the icon has to do
  from across a room.
-->
